# ==============================================================================
# AWP HYBRID ARCHITECTURE MANIFEST
# ==============================================================================
# BASE FRAMEWORK: Mint-Y-Dark-Aqua from LMDE 7.0
# GTK+ 3.0 / 4.0: Tweaked SVG Layouts (Dynamic Color Modulation Support)
# GTK+ 2.0 (LEGACY): Integrated Mint-Style Control Assets (PNG Matrix)
# TARGET COMPATIBILITY: XFCE 4.18+ / Desktop Framework Unification
